sequenceDiagram
    actor U as User
    participant UI as Gradio UI (app.py, analyze)
    participant P as predict() (inference.py)

    U->>UI: Enter review, click Analiz et (or press Enter)
    UI->>P: predict(text or "")

    alt Valid text (happy path)
        opt Planned (FR-7), not implemented yet: more than 128 tokens
            P->>P: Truncate input to 128 tokens
            Note over P,UI: How the UI learns about truncation is not defined in the contract yet
        end
        P-->>UI: dict with all 7 aspects, each {label, confidence}
        UI->>UI: Split mentioned aspects from yok aspects (FR-4)
        UI->>UI: Map keys to display names (ASPECT_DISPLAY, LABEL_DISPLAY)
        UI-->>U: Result table (Özellik, Duygu, Güven) and yok accordion
    else Empty or whitespace-only text (FR-6)
        P-->>UI: raises ValueError
        UI-->>U: Warning message, empty result table
    else Text is not a str
        P-->>UI: raises TypeError
        UI-->>U: Same warning message, empty result table
    end
